              "q": "What does this print?",
              "a_bullets": [
                "`false true hi`",
                "`toUpperCase()` returns a new String, and the result was dropped, so `s` is unchanged",
                "`new String` makes a separate object: `==` is false, `equals` is true"
              ],
              "example_code": [
                "String s = \"hi\";",
