              "type": "qa",
              "q": "What does `y == \"ab\"` give here, and why?",
              "a_bullets": [
                "`false`: `x` is not final, so the concatenation runs at runtime and makes a new object",
                "With `final String x`, it would be a compile-time constant: `true`"
              ],
              "example_code": [
                "String x = \"a\";",
                "String y = x + \"b\";"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "qa",
              "q": "Spot the bug: what does `t.names().size()` return, and how do you fix it?",
              "a_bullets": [
